
---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About ProfOps | Let's Explore Together"
  description="Discover ProfOps, an independent engineering platform for practical insights, hands-on labs and community contributions."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="intro">
        <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT PROFOPS</span>
        <h1>Let's Explore <span class="gradient">Together.</span></h1>

        <p class="lead">
          ProfOps is an independent engineering platform for sharing
          real-world experiences, technical insights, and ideas
          worth exploring together.
        </p>

        <p class="muted">
          Technology never stops evolving, and neither does our curiosity.
          ProfOps brings practical engineering knowledge, experiments,
          and different perspectives into one place.
          It's a space to share what we've learned, ask new questions,
          and explore what we don't know yet.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section class="section">
        <span class="eyebrow">WHAT YOU'LL FIND HERE</span>
        <h2>Engineering beyond theory.</h2>

        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <span class="tag">INSIGHTS</span>
            <h3>Real-World Engineering</h3>
            <p>
              Practical experiences, technical challenges,
              architectural decisions, and lessons learned.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <span class="tag">LABS</span>
            <h3>Hands-on Experiments</h3>
            <p>
              Technical walkthroughs, automation examples,
              open-source projects, and experiments.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <span class="tag">PERSPECTIVES</span>
            <h3>Technology & Beyond</h3>
            <p>
              Exploring DevOps, Platform Engineering,
              Cloud Native, SRE, AI and the evolving
              engineering landscape.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <span class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</span>
        <h2>Knowledge grows when we share it.</h2>

        <p class="muted">
          ProfOps is not intended to be a one-person publication.
          Engineers, technology enthusiasts, and curious minds
          are welcome to contribute their experiences and perspectives.
        </p>

        <p class="muted">
          Have a topic you'd like us to explore?
          A technical question worth investigating?
          Or an experience you'd like to share?
          Let's explore ideas together.
        </p>

        <div class="feature">
          <div>
            <h2>Be part of ProfOps.</h2>
            <p class="muted">
              Suggest a topic, share feedback, contribute a project,
              or become a guest author.
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            class="button"
            href="https://github.com/profops"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Join the Conversation ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section founder">
        <span class="eyebrow">MEET THE FOUNDER</span>
        <h2>The person behind ProfOps.</h2>

        <div class="founder-content">
          <div class="founder-photo">
            <img
              src="/images/seda-kurt.png"
              alt="Seda Kurt, founder of ProfOps"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3>Seda Kurt</h3>
            <p class="founder-role">
              Platform & DevOps Engineer
            </p>

            <p class="muted">
              I'm a computer engineer with over a decade of experience
              working with infrastructure, DevOps, cloud-native
              technologies, and platform engineering.
            </p>

            <p class="muted">
              I created ProfOps to share practical engineering
              experiences, explore emerging technologies,
              and build a space where curiosity and
              knowledge sharing bring people together.
            </p>

            <a
              class="button secondary"
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/seda-kurt/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Connect on LinkedIn ↗
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>